{"id":"n23381-1-7","stage":0,"title":"고등학생 · 高中生","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23381-1-7-1","ko":"네가 벌써 열일곱 살이니?","zh":"你已经十七岁了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열일곱","meaning":"17（固有数词）","explanation":"열일곱：17（固有数词）","readings":[{"term":"열일곱","audio":"/audio/7568dd99516511cddbe8.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"살이니?","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]}],"audio":"/audio/509c055b69e74c82c225.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23381-1-7-2","ko":"네, 이번에 고등학생이 되었어요.","zh":"是的，这次我成为高中生了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고등학생이","meaning":"高中生","explanation":"고등학생：高中生；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"고등학생","audio":"/audio/b4982ece8446557ab298.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23381","senseId":"1","lemma":"고등학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었어요.","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"b4982ece8446557a","term":"고등학생","zh":"高中生","audio":"/audio/b4982ece8446557ab298.mp3","entryId":"23381","definition":"读高中的学生。","pronunciation":["고등학쌩"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/80c69583789f6757f2ee.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23381","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":18,"sequenceScore":0.7176,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，这次我成为高中生了。","你已经十七岁了吗？","你现在有时间吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你已经十七岁了吗？","你现在有时间吗？","是的，这次我成为高中生了。"],"answer":2}]}
